Spoiler

This should work to reduce the height of the title menu:
JavaScript:
;void (alias => {
  const ROWS = -1;  // increase height by this many rows
  Scene_Title.prototype.commandWindowRect = function() {
    const rect = alias.apply(this, arguments);
    rect.height += ROWS * Window_Selectable.prototype.itemHeight();
    return rect;
  };
})(Scene_Title.prototype.commandWindowRect);
You can change its position via
Database -> System 1 -> Title Screen: Command Window
.
